%% Routing, not a call graph. The main thread is the only dispatcher: it opens
%% one role session at a time (solid edges). A role never invokes another role;
%% the Chief of Staff routes by returning a delegation request the main thread
%% validates and dispatches itself (dashed edge). See
%% founder-os/references/orchestration.md. The Portfolio Manager exists on
%% multi-business installs and ranks between businesses.
graph TD
    F[YOU — Founder] --> MT[Main thread]
    MT --> COS[Chief of Staff]
    COS -. delegation request .-> MT
    MT --> BM[Board Member]
    MT --> PM[Portfolio Manager]
    MT --> ST[Strategist]
    MT --> PA[Positioning Advisor]
    MT --> PC[Pipeline Coach]
    MT --> BE[Brand Editor]
    MT --> NM[Network Manager]
    MT --> DL[Delivery Lead]
    MT --> CFO[CFO]
    MT --> OE[Ops Engineer]
    MT --> FC[Focus Coach]
    MT --> SM[Skills Mentor]
